      "role": "user",
      "content": "it feels like i'm just walking around as a ghost. like, the version of me that actually mattered, the one that lived and breathed and competed... that person died when the injury happened. now im just this shell of a person. i look in the mirror and i dont even recognize the person staring back. it's just... quiet. everything is so quiet now.",
