      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not a \"quiet place of rest,\" it's a void. there's no new meaning coming. it feels like the story already reached its climax and then just... dragged on for no reason. like the book is finished, but the pages just keep turning even though the characters are all gone. i feel like i'm just stalled out in the epilogue of a life that already ended.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
